---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateCard from '../../components/AffiliateCard.astro';

const type = "ISTJ";
const nickname = "The Inspector";
const tagline = "Reliable, precise, and quietly essential — the backbone of any institution that actually works.";

const strengths = [
  "Exceptional reliability and follow-through",
  "Meticulous attention to detail",
  "Strong sense of duty and responsibility",
  "Calm under pressure",
  "Consistent and fair in applying rules",
];

const growthEdges = [
  "Can be inflexible when faced with change",
  "May dismiss innovative ideas too quickly",
  "Tends to over-rely on precedent",
  "Can come across as rigid or overly serious",
  "Difficulty expressing feelings openly",
];

const careers = [
  "Accountant / Auditor", "Military Officer", "Judge / Magistrate",
  "Database Administrator", "Civil Engineer", "Logistics Manager",
];

const stats = [
  { label: "Population", value: "~11–14%" },
  { label: "Energy", value: "Introverted" },
  { label: "Information", value: "Sensing" },
  { label: "Decisions", value: "Thinking" },
  { label: "Lifestyle", value: "Judging" },
];

const loveStyle = {
  summary: `ISTJs are steadfast, responsible, and deeply loyal partners. They show love through consistency — keeping commitments, maintaining stability, and being reliably present over years and decades. An ISTJ's love may not come with poetry, but it comes with proof: they are there, every time.`,
  what_they_need: `Clarity, reliability, and a partner who takes their commitments as seriously as they do. ISTJs invest heavily in relationships they believe in and need to know that investment is mutual. Broken promises erode trust in ways that are difficult to repair.`,
  challenge: `Adapting to emotional change and expressing affection. ISTJs can struggle when a partner's emotional needs shift unexpectedly or when the relationship requires departing from established patterns. Developing emotional flexibility — meeting a partner's present state rather than their expected state — takes deliberate effort.`,
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ISTJ Personality: Love, Strengths & Careers | TypeInsight"
  description="How does the ISTJ love? Romantic style, relationship needs, career paths and growth areas for The Inspector. MBTI 恋愛 ISTJ / ISTJ 恋爱."
  faqItems={[
    {
      question: "How does an ISTJ act in a romantic relationship?",
      answer: "ISTJs are steadfast, reliable partners who express love through consistency and kept promises. They are deeply loyal and build relationships on a foundation of trust and shared responsibility — but may need to consciously work on emotional expression and flexibility.",
    },
    {
      question: "ISTJ の恋愛スタイルは？(ISTJ love style / ISTJ 恋爱风格)",
      answer: "ISTJ types love through proof: they show up, they follow through, and they stay. Their love language is reliability. They need a partner who matches their commitment level and understands that consistency is their deepest form of affection.",
    },
    {
      question: "What MBTI type is most compatible with ISTJ?",
      answer: "ESFPs and ESTPs are often cited as complementary matches for ISTJs — they bring warmth, spontaneity, and present-focus that balances the ISTJ's structured and traditional orientation. ESFP is a particularly common pairing.",
    },
  ]}
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-12">
    <p class="mono-cap mb-4">Your Result</p>
    <h1 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-ink leading-none mb-2" style="font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6rem);letter-spacing:-0.06em;line-height:0.9">{type}</h1>
    <p class="font-sans text-2xl font-semibold text-clay mb-4">{nickname}</p>
    <p class="font-sans text-ink-mute max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed">{tagline}</p>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a href="/test" class="inline-block font-sans text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" style="border:1px solid rgba(31,26,20,0.28)">Retake the Test</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink mb-5" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em;">Profile</h2>
        <div class="font-sans text-ink-mute text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>The ISTJ — Introverted, Sensing, Thinking, Judging — is The Inspector: the most common type by some estimates and the foundation of stability in nearly every institution. ISTJs do what they say they will do. In a world of overpromisers, this is a genuine rarity.</p>
          <p>ISTJs are not drawn to innovation for its own sake. They are drawn to what works — and they will defend proven methods with the same tenacity others reserve for new ideas. This is not stubbornness; it is a deeply rational preference for reliability over novelty.</p>
          <p>At their best, ISTJs are the people who make complex organisations function. They absorb responsibility without complaint, master their domain thoroughly, and build reputations for quiet competence over years and decades. They are the last to leave when things go wrong and the first to have a checklist ready.</p>
          <p>Their growth edge lies in flexibility. As environments change — and they always do — ISTJs who resist adaptation can find themselves protecting systems that have outlived their usefulness. Learning to interrogate tradition rather than simply preserve it is the central developmental task for this type.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Ad: 300x250 Banner -->
      <div>
        <script>
          atOptions = {
            'key' : '6d2f9a9789ee0cb5604b21dbdb334ecb',
            'format' : 'iframe',
            'height' : 250,
            'width' : 300,
            'params' : {}
          };
        </script>
        <script src="https://www.highperformanceformat.com/6d2f9a9789ee0cb5604b21dbdb334ecb/invoke.js"></script>
      </div>

            <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink mb-5" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em;">Strengths</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {strengths.map(s => (
            <li class="flex gap-3 items-start font-sans text-sm text-ink">
              <span class="text-sage font-bold mt-0.5">&#10003;</span><span>{s}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink mb-5" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em;">Growth Edges</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {growthEdges.map(g => (
            <li class="flex gap-3 items-start font-sans text-sm text-ink">
              <span class="text-clay font-bold mt-0.5">&rarr;</span><span>{g}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink mb-5" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em;">Career Paths</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {careers.map(c => (
            <span class="font-sans text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-ink-soft"
                  style="background:#ECEFE2;border:1px solid var(--ink-line);">{c}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Love & Relationships -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink mb-2" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em;">
          Love &amp; Relationships
        </h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-ink-mute mb-5" style="letter-spacing:0.02em;">
          <span lang="ja">恋愛スタイル</span> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <span lang="zh-Hans">恋爱类型</span>
        </p>
        <div class="font-sans text-ink-mute text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>{loveStyle.summary}</p>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-ink text-sm" style="letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
            What they need in a partner
          </h3>
          <p>{loveStyle.what_they_need}</p>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-ink text-sm" style="letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
            Relationship challenge
          </h3>
          <p>{loveStyle.challenge}</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="mt-12 lg:mt-0 space-y-8">
      <!-- Ad: 160x300 Banner -->
      <div>
        <script>
          atOptions = {
            'key' : '70ef5f288f802563b40dd7d981408065',
            'format' : 'iframe',
            'height' : 300,
            'width' : 160,
            'params' : {}
          };
        </script>
        <script src="https://www.highperformanceformat.com/70ef5f288f802563b40dd7d981408065/invoke.js"></script>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-paper rounded-[36px] p-6" style="border:1px solid var(--ink-line)">
        <p class="mono-cap mb-4">At a Glance</p>
        <dl class="space-y-3">
          {stats.map(({ label, value }) => (
            <div class="flex justify-between text-sm font-sans pb-2" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink-line)">
              <dt class="text-ink-mute">{label}</dt>
              <dd class="text-ink font-semibold">{value}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>
      </div>
      <AffiliateCard type="betterhelp" />
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
